WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.593
When a scalar query feels confusing isolate the
inner query mentally Ask

00:00:06.619 --> 00:00:13.573
what it returns Here it returns one average age Now

00:00:13.586 --> 00:00:19.436
imagine replacing the parenthesized SELECT with that
number The outer query

00:00:19.463 --> 00:00:25.210
becomes an ordinary age comparison This simple
mental substitution

00:00:25.236 --> 00:00:27.499
works well for many scalar subqueries
